OL,3,GNEWSAFounder accused of stealing #5m   
OL,4,Afrom elite college 'had no idea' what  
OL,5,Astudents paid                          
OL,7,FA woman accused of stealing millions   
OL,8,Ffrom an elite college said she was not 
OL,9,Finvolved in the institution's finances 
OL,10,Fand had "no idea" how much students    
OL,11,Fwere paying.                           
OL,13,FYasmin Sarwar, 45, from Cyncoed,       
OL,14,FCardiff, is accused of stealing #5m    
OL,15,Ffrom Cardiff Sixth Form College's      
OL,16,Faccounts. Her ex-husband, Nadeem       
OL,17,FSarwar, pleaded guilty to stealing #5m 
OL,18,Fat an earlier hearing.                 
OL,20,FYasmin Sarwar, who was a director and  
OL,21,Ftrustee at the college, denies nine    
OL,22,Ftheft and fraud charges.               
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
