OL,4,Afrom elite college 'had no idea' what  
OL,5,Astudents paid                          
OL,7,FMerthyr Tydfil Crown Court heard she   
OL,8,Finitially began offering tuition to    
OL,9,Fstudents in her conservatory after     
OL,10,Fbeing "cut off" from others by her     
OL,11,Fex-husband.                            
